# functionarysound (the sound script sound/functionarysound.py of the game): the sound files of the character class
# (LoadSounds), the sound events of its actions (SetSounds and the Talk sections, through Chars.ActSound), the loops of
# a new entity (InitLoops, $e its handle) and Init, which runs them with $char the class. The format is described in
# src/game/Script/Script.c; the C is in src/game/Script/Sounds.c. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/sound/functionarysound.def
# replaces this file.

section LoadSounds
class
	AddSoundRes paso-funcionario1.wav
	AddSoundRes paso-funcionario2.wav
	AddSoundRes mecanismo-funcionario1.wav
if %FunctionarySound.isPC
	class
		AddSoundRes mecanismo-funcionario2.wav
end
	AddSoundRes mecanismo-funcionario3.wav
if %FunctionarySound.isPC
	class
		AddSoundRes mecanismo-funcionario4.wav
end
	AddSoundRes mecanismo-funcionario5.wav
	AddSoundRes mecanismo-funcionario6.wav
	AddSoundRes caida-funcionario.wav
	AddSoundRes keyboard1.wav
	AddSoundRes keyboard2.wav
	AddSoundRes effectfast.wav

